From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Nov 2025 20:32:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add complete navigation menu with all PRD modules

Added 6 new pages based on PRD requirements:
- Admissions - Online admission system
- Evaluations - Student progress and evaluations
- Events - Events and trips management
- HR - HR and payroll management
- Finance - Accounting and finance
- Inventory - Inventory and assets management

Updated Navigation:
- Added all 10 modules to the navigation bar
- Made navigation responsive with smaller text on medium screens
- Used horizontal scrolling for overflow on smaller screens
- All menu items now visible with proper active state highlighting

Routes:
- Added routes for all new pages in App.tsx
- Each page has a consistent dark mode design
- Placeholder content ready for future implementation

The navigation now shows all core modules from the PRD!
